# direnv: load the dev shell defined in flake.nix on every `cd` into the
# workspace. Requires `nix-direnv` to be installed and hooked into your
# shell — see docs/DEVELOPMENT.md for setup.
use flake

# `.env` is deliberately not exported here. build.rs reads it directly and is
# its only parser, so baked-in credentials and station settings cannot depend
# on whether a build ran under direnv (direnv's dotenv rules for duplicates,
# comments and `$` expansion differ). Process variables still override `.env`.
